by kbond at 2026-11-10T23:16:43Z

Could we let third-party makers opt in with `@AcmeBundle/report/Report.tpl.php`? Check `templates/bundles/AcmeBundle/report/Report.tpl.php` in the app first, then use `kernel.bundles_metadata` to find the bundle’s copy.

`make:twig-component` passes absolute paths for `twig/Component.tpl.php`, `twig/LiveComponent.tpl.php`, and `twig/component_template.tpl.php`. Switching them to named references would make all three overridable.

