by GromNaN at 2026-11-11T09:49:13Z

Thanks @kbond for the suggestion. Named references like `@AcmeBundle/report/Report.tpl.php` now follow the same resolution as Twig bundle templates in Symfony, and they are useful for bundles that ship their own makers and templates. This is implemented in the latest commit.
